        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-serif text-xl mb-4">1. Publisher</h2>
          <p><strong class="text-white">MICH</strong> — trading as <strong class="text-white">JANUS</strong><br/>
          SASU (French simplified joint-stock company) with share capital of €1,000<br/>
          Registered office: 20 ter rue Julien, 69003 Lyon, France<br/>
          RCS Lyon 903 358 430 — SIRET: <strong class="text-gold">90335843000010</strong><br/>
          Training provider activity declaration no. <strong class="text-gold">84 69 20025 69</strong>, registered with the Prefect of the Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes region. This registration does not constitute State approval.<br/>
          Qualiopi certification no. <strong class="text-gold">25FOR01416.3</strong>, issued for the category: training activities<br/>
          Email: <a href="mailto:contact@agence-janus.fr" class="text-gold hover:text-gold-light transition-colors">contact@agence-janus.fr</a><br/>
          Website: <span class="text-white">agence-janus.fr</span></p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-serif text-xl mb-4">2. Publication Director</h2>
          <p>Agata Mich, legal representative of MICH.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-serif text-xl mb-4">3. Hosting</h2>
          <p><strong class="text-white">Vercel Inc.</strong><br/>
          440 N Barranca Ave #4133<br/>
          Covina, CA 91723, United States<br/>
          <a href="https://vercel.com" class="text-gold hover:text-gold-light transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener">vercel.com</a></p>
          <p class="mt-3">European visitor data is processed in datacentres located within the European Union in accordance with Vercel's GDPR commitments.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-serif text-xl mb-4">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All content on this website (text, visuals, logo, structure) is the exclusive property of Janus I Communication Interculturelle and is protected by copyright. Any reproduction, in whole or in part, is prohibited without prior written authorisation.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-serif text-xl mb-4">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>Janus I Communication Interculturelle endeavours to keep the information published on this site accurate and up to date, but cannot guarantee its completeness or accuracy. JANUS shall not be liable for any direct or indirect damages resulting from the use of this site or the inability to access it.</p>
